// Quiz for the Initializing a Repository topic

::Using Git::
Which is NOT an advantage of using Git?
{
=The full version of a repository is maintained only on a central server.
~It is more secure.
~Branching allows for simultaneous code versions.
~Simpler to roll back mistakes.
}

::Using Git::
Which is NOT an advantage of using Git?
{
~Allows for easier collaboration.
=Protects projects by not allowing open source code.
~Encourages code reviews.
~Good documentation.
}


::Using Git::
Which is the command for starting a new repository in Git?
{
=git init
~git start
~git create
~git mkdir
}

::Using Git::
Which is the command for copying from an existing repository in Git?
{
~git copy
~git cp
=git clone
~git mv
}
